#: ../../source/reference/generated/utils/pams.utils.json_extends.rst:7
msgid "json_extends"
msgstr ""

#: of pams.utils.json_extends.json_extends:1
msgid "extend target json."
msgstr "対象のJSONを拡張します。"

#: of pams.utils.json_extends.json_extends:3
msgid ""
"If \"extends\" keys are included in target_json, this try to extend the json"
" dict recursively. For the extension, the value for \"extends\" field  is "
"found in whole_json and target_json is extended using the dict under the "
"found part of whole_json. This process is recursively repeated. "
"\"parent_name\" is only used for avoiding circle extension of target_json "
"and it should be parent key of target_json."
msgstr ""
"target_json に \"extends\" "
"キーが含まれている場合、JSONのdictを再帰的に拡張しようとします。拡張では、\"extends\" フィールドの値を whole_json "
"から探し、whole_json の該当箇所にあるdictを用いて target_json "
"を拡張します。この処理は再帰的に繰り返されます。\"parent_name\" は target_json "
"の循環的な拡張を避けるためだけに使用され、target_json の親キーである必要があります。"

#: of pams.utils.json_extends.json_extends
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of pams.utils.json_extends.json_extends:10
msgid "whole of json."
msgstr "JSON全体。"

